## Risks/Unknowns

- **Package release delay:** The PR is held until the updated package is released; this may cause delays to build and test cycles.
- **Kernel compatibility:** The driver version may have compatibility issues with the kernel version in the base image.
- **Firmware availability:** Some Broadcom wireless drivers require specific firmware versions that may not be available in all environments.
- **Missing dependencies:** The driver may require additional kernel dependencies not yet resolved.
- **DKMS integration:** Additional configuration may be needed for DKMS integration.

